		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Human-sized red crab. Four arms, each ending in an item of torture.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 torture device +4 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Implant</strong>. Lay egg inside helpless or willing mortal host. CHA 18+ or lose 1 INT permanently. Repeat check once per day; ends on success. At 1 INT, host turns into mindless vermin.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
